    "Las letras vienen de LRCLIB, una base comunitaria: no las provee Spotify y pueden faltar o tener errores. Con sincronía por palabra se resaltan mientras suenan; si no, se ve la estrofa completa." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lyrics come from LRCLIB, a community database: they aren't provided by Spotify and may be missing or contain mistakes. With word-by-word sync, words light up as they're sung; otherwise you see the whole verse."
