    },
    "No ve tu contraseña. En tus playlists solo agrega lo que vos elijas." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It never sees your password. It only adds to your playlists what you choose."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nowdeck es un proyecto open source independiente. No está afiliado a Spotify ni cuenta con su aval." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nowdeck is an independent open source project. It isn't affiliated with or endorsed by Spotify."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nowdeck maneja la música de cualquier dispositivo con tu cuenta de Spotify. Para eso necesita una app de desarrollador tuya: se crea una sola vez y lleva unos 5 minutos." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nowdeck controls the music on any device signed in to your Spotify account. To do that it needs your own developer app: you create it once, and it takes about 5 minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nowdeck ya está conectado a tu Spotify. Girá el iPhone y apoyalo en el escritorio." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nowdeck is now connected to your Spotify. Turn your iPhone sideways and stand it on your desk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
