      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "From the artwork"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sesión privada" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Private session"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Si Spotify la detecta, podría bloquear el Client ID de tu app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If Spotify detects it, it could block your app's Client ID."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Si es un parlante o una tele, despertalo primero: en reposo no aparece." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If it's a speaker or a TV, wake it up first: it doesn't show up while asleep."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Siguiente" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Next"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sin ajuste. Si las letras van tarde, tocá +; si se adelantan, tocá −." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No adjustment. If the lyrics lag behind, tap +; if they run ahead, tap −."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sin conexión con Spotify" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Can't reach Spotify"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sin datos" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No data"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sincronía de las letras" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lyrics timing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Solo aparecen tus playlists y las colaborativas. Para quitar temas, usá Spotify." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only your own and collaborative playlists appear. To remove songs, use Spotify."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Solo deja ver los temas de las playlists que creaste o en las que colaborás. Podés reproducirla igual, o verla en Spotify." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It only shows the songs of playlists you created or collaborate on. You can still play it, or view it in Spotify."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Son 32 letras y números. Se guarda solo en este iPhone, en el Llavero." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It's 32 letters and numbers. It's stored only on this iPhone, in the Keychain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify Premium" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify Premium"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify no aceptó el comando. Revisá que tu cuenta tenga Premium." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify didn't accept the command. Check that your account has Premium."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify no deja leer tu biblioteca con esta cuenta. Revisá que siga en Users Management, en el panel de Spotify." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify doesn't allow reading your library with this account. Check that it's still in User Management, on the Spotify dashboard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify no deja usar tu app" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify won't allow your app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify no deja usar tu app con esa cuenta. Entrá con la misma cuenta de siempre." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify doesn't allow your app with that account. Sign in with your usual account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify no deja usar tu app con esta cuenta. Entrá con la misma cuenta con la que creaste la app, o sumala en Users Management, en los ajustes de tu app en el panel de Spotify." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify doesn't allow your app with this account. Sign in with the account you created the app with, or add it in User Management, in your app's settings on the Spotify dashboard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify no deja ver estos temas con esta cuenta." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify doesn't allow viewing these songs with this account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify no dejó agregarlo. Puede que ya no puedas editar esa playlist." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify didn't allow adding it. You may no longer be able to edit that playlist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify no dejó leer tus carpetas. Se muestran tus playlists sin agrupar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify didn't allow reading your folders. Your playlists are shown ungrouped."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify no dejó reproducirlo. Revisá que tu cuenta tenga Premium." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify didn't allow playing it. Check that your account has Premium."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify no la aprueba para apps de terceros." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify doesn't approve it for third-party apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify no les muestra tus carpetas a las apps como Nowdeck: la biblioteca muestra tus playlists sueltas, sin agrupar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify doesn't show your folders to apps like Nowdeck: the library shows your playlists on their own, ungrouped."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify no muestra los temas de esta playlist" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify doesn't show this playlist's songs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify no reconoce este Client ID. Revisá que sea el de tu app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify doesn't recognize this Client ID. Check that it's your app's."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify pide esperar un momento. Probá de nuevo en unos segundos." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify asks to wait a moment. Try again in a few seconds."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify pide esperar. Probá de nuevo en un momento." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify asks to wait. Try again in a moment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify pidió esperar un momento. Probá de nuevo en un rato." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify asked to wait a moment. Try again in a while."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify rechazó el pedido. Revisá que tu cuenta tenga Premium y siga en Users Management de tu app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify rejected the request. Check that your account has Premium and is still in your app's User Management."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spotify ya no reconoce el Client ID guardado. Puede que la app se haya borrado en el panel de Spotify: pegá el Client ID de tu app o creá una nueva." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spotify no longer recognizes the saved Client ID. The app may have been deleted on the Spotify dashboard: paste your app's Client ID or create a new one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suavizan y oscurecen la foto del artista para que el título se lea mejor. Mientras movés uno, ves cómo queda." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "They soften and dim the artist photo so the title is easier to read. While you move one, you see how it looks."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subir volumen" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Volume up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suena en" : {
